OL,3,AFrom Levi's to Primark - the fashion
OL,4,Achains selling mended clothes
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf Alice Brown is browsing in
OL,7,Fsecond-hand shops and finds a jumper
OL,8,Fwith a hole, that won't stop her buying
OL,9,Fit.
OL,11,F"I see it as challenge," says the
OL,12,F27-year-old forest ranger from
OL,13,FLincolnshire.
OL,15,FShe is a champion of the growing
OL,16,Ffashion for eye-catching repairs.
OL,18,FOver the last year she has developed
OL,19,Fher own unique style, needle-felting
OL,20,Fcute animals and insects to cover moth
OL,21,Fholes, stains and other imperfections,
OL,22,Fwinning her a huge following online.
